# SRI-pinned vendored assets: their `integrity=` hash in src/aia/index.html is
# computed from the committed (LF) bytes. Mark them `binary` so git never
# rewrites line endings on any platform or under any `core.autocrlf` setting.
# The docker-compose bind mount serves the working-copy bytes straight to the
# browser, which verifies them against the `integrity=` attribute, so the served
# bytes must equal the committed blob. CI (`frontend-lint`) re-hashes every
# pinned file on a clean checkout and fails on any mismatch.
src/aia/scripts/marked.min.js             binary
src/aia/scripts/dompurify.min.js          binary
src/aia/scripts/highlight.min.js          binary
src/aia/scripts/katex.min.js              binary
src/aia/scripts/katex-auto-render.min.js  binary
src/aia/scripts/diff-match-patch.js       binary
src/aia/scripts/mermaid.min.js            binary
src/aia/css/katex.min.css                 binary
src/aia/css/highlight.min.css             binary
